	(text "NOTE: net names are kept as in the Cambridge service manual. The output of THIS (left) channel is RO;\nits other channel nets are RE1, RE2, RFCLIP, RICLIP. The Right Channel sheet uses LO, LE1, LE2, LFCLIP, LICLIP.\nThe L/R letters in these net names do not match the channel names - this is how the manual names them."
